  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v1.4.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v1.3.0:\n\n- Zero the native plaintext TryGet loads before freeing it (#209) (matt-edmondson)\n- Read a stored value its SemanticString type refuses as not found [patch] (#217) (matt-edmondson)\n- Refuse a lone surrogate when saving instead of storing U+FFFD [patch] (#218) (matt-edmondson)\n- Suppress Polyfill shim drift in package validation [patch] (#220) (matt-edmondson)\n- Refuse a null non-nullable credential property when reading or saving (#204) (matt-edmondson)\n- Ignore Dispose on the process-wide Instance [patch] (#202) (matt-edmondson)\n- Write credential JSON with relaxed escaping so Windows' blob cap counts real bytes (#203) (matt-edmondson)\n- Refuse an unregistered Credential subclass in every store's Save, not only AddOrReplace [patch] (#207) (matt-edmondson)\n- Drop the type parameter name from the ArgumentExceptions RegisterDerivedType throws (Claude)\n- [minor] Let consumers register their own Credential subclasses (Claude)\n- Move schema caching into a testable NativeHandleCache (Claude)\n- Throw CredentialStoreException, not TypeInitializationException, when libsecret is missing [patch] (Claude)\n- Merge main into fix/166-macos-itemref-without-secret (matt-edmondson)\n- Look macOS items up by reference without decrypting the secret [patch] (matt-edmondson)\n- Zero an over-limit credential blob in the Windows store [patch] (matt-edmondson)\n- Move CI onto the shared ci-shared.yml pipeline (Claude)\n- Cover ThrowIfError with a GError built by glib (Claude)\n- Read GError.message at its real offset on 64-bit Linux [patch] (Claude)\n- [patch] Return null, not throw, for stored JSON with no $type discriminator (Claude)\n- Merge main into the Linux scrubbing branch (Claude)\n- test: cover the Linux store's scrub path in the shared layer [patch] (Claude)\n- fix: scrub Linux Secret Service plaintext like Windows and macOS [patch] (Claude)\n- fix: serialize cache and store mutations per persona [patch] (Claude)\n- test: address SonarCloud findings on the scrubbing tests (matt-edmondson)\n- fix: scrub plaintext credential buffers before releasing them [patch] (matt-edmondson)\n- Gate Dependabot auto-merge on CI actually being green (Claude)\n- fix: persist a credential before caching it in AddOrReplace [patch] (matt-edmondson)\n- ci: adopt the consolidated .NET workflow [patch] (Claude)\n- ci: make the SonarQube quality gate opt in [patch] (matt-edmondson)\n- ci: adopt the unified dotnet workflow [patch] (matt-edmondson)\n- chore: store icon.png in LFS as .gitattributes declares (matt-edmondson)\n- docs: scope build badge to the default branch (matt-edmondson)\n- docs: correct README, DESCRIPTION and TAGS metadata (matt-edmondson)\n- Stop Update SDKs failing when there is nothing to update (matt-edmondson)\n- Fix ktsu.Sdk 2.27 analyzer errors: Polyfill PrivateAssets, InternalsVisibleTo [patch] (matt-edmondson)\n- Sync .github\\workflows\\dotnet.yml (KtsuTools)\n- Sync .editorconfig (KtsuTools)\n- Sync global.json (KtsuTools)\n- Sync .github\\workflows\\dotnet.yml (KtsuTools)\n- chore: update ktsu.Sdk to 2.21.1 [patch] (matt-edmondson)\n- chore: resolve package version merge conflict (matt-edmondson)\n- chore: remove unused SourceLink package versions (matt-edmondson)\n- chore: reconcile package references and central versions (matt-edmondson)\n- Refresh README for 2.0.0 surface (Claude)",
